  << /ActualText (In 2018\054 \nAs a Director\054 Cinematographer and Editor \054 \034The Last Day\035 short film https\072\057\057www\056facebook\056com\057ShortSweetMalaysia\057photos\057a\0561899089380183477\0571899089806850101\n\n\n\042 The Best Actor Award at Short\053Sweet Film Malaysia Film Festival \n\n\nIn 2020\054 As a Producer and Editor\054 \034Queen of Trash\035 documentary film   https\072\057\057wffcinema\056com\057movies\0575f55f16be03dc74655003ce8\n\n\n\042 Emerging Filmmaker Award at Wathann film Festival\n)
