770 0 obj
  << /ActualText (TRAINING \046 WORKSHOP\n\nMass Media\054 Batch\1372 at The Sun Institute Myanmar Campaigning \046 Advocacy\n\042 Learning about political Science\054Journalism and introduction of video journalism\056\n\nJournalism Training at Center for Myanmar Media Development\n\042 Learning about political Science\054 Journalism\054 Media Law and photojournalism\056\n\nOn Job Training at Goethe Institute Myanmar for MIZZIMA TV Program\n\042 Learning about how to make a digital TV magazine\054 story idea pitching\054 how to develop story script\054 how to make pre\055production for a program\054 how to shoot creative videography\054 advance video editing\054 how to make post production and how to get great engagement from the audience in social media\056\n\nAdvance Photography at Thit San Group\n\042 indoor photo shooting\054 outdoor photo shooting and retouch photo\056\n\nFilm and Society Course\n\042 Wathann Film Institute https\072\057\057www\056facebook\056com\057wathannfilmfestival\n and the compound from FAMU https\072\057\057international\056famu\056cz\057\n by opening a filmmaker production course called \035the Film and Society Filmmaking Course\035\056 \n\042  Learning about how to produce an independence film\054 how to write a script for film\054 how to develop a script\054 how to manage film shooting\054 cinematography and film editing\056\n\nJENESYS 2018 Inbound program\n\042 7th Batch Myanmar \050Culture\051 Exchange for Film and Art\nhttps\072\057\057www\056facebook\056com\057groups\057713276822368632\n\n\nOther Area Experience\n\nVolunteer and Media Contact Person at Thousand Smiles Charity Group \024 2015\n\042 Reporting\054 Photo Shooting\054 Contacting Local Media and releasing newsletters \n\nProducer and Editor at Dating Day Short Film \024 2018\n\042 Producer and Editor\n\nInternship at Wathann Film Institute \024 2018\n\042 \050Media Team for Wathann Film Festival\051\n\nPost Production Trainer at Goethe Institute for Myanmar Education Channel \0242020\n)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 771 0 R
     /Pg 766 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
